OL,3,GNEWSAHomes plan for mill with 'huge
OL,4,Aamount of history'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19th Century mill site in Bronte
OL,7,FCountry - described as "one of the last
OL,8,Fmills in the area" - could be converted
OL,9,Finto housing.
OL,11,FAn application to demolish sections of
OL,12,FVale Mill, a short distance from
OL,13,FOakworth Station, has been submitted to
OL,14,FBradford Council.
OL,16,FApplication documents say a Grade II
OL,17,Flisted section of the mill would be
OL,18,Fretained and converted, but an unused
OL,19,Farea would be demolished if plans are
OL,20,Fapproved.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
