OL,3,GNEWSAHomes plan for mill with 'huge
OL,4,Aamount of history'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demolition application submitted by
OL,7,FJonathan Heaton says the site will be
OL,8,Fvacant by the end of the year, with
OL,9,Fwork getting under way in December if
OL,10,Fapproved. A bid for homes is expected
OL,11,Fto be submitted in the near future.
